WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.057
Our Union is based
on the tripod of democracy,

00:00:04.082 --> 00:00:07.102
human rights
and the rule of law.

00:00:07.438 --> 00:00:09.278
And through the European history,

00:00:09.336 --> 00:00:13.056
we know that if we abandon
one of the legs of the tripod,

00:00:13.268 --> 00:00:14.861
the whole tripod will topple.

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:17.747
Never can one be used against the other,

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.516
if we do not want to
revisit the horrible

00:00:20.541 --> 00:00:23.624
mistakes that Europeans
have made in our past.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.920
Europe is ultimately 
an idea and a promise

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.253
that it is possible
to overcome age old antagonisms.

00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:32.618
That it is possible to live together,

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.800
trade together,
work together in freedom and peace.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.080
Freedom,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.240
freedom is what 
so many people fought for.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.369
The European Union –
based on the rule of law,

00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:45.944
democracy and 
respect for human rights –

00:00:46.466 --> 00:00:51.762
is the concrete expression of the will 
of freedom of 500 million Europeans.

